   "text": "Royal Holloway University of London International Study Centre - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nRoyal Holloway University of London International Study Centre\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nRoyal Holloway is one of the top research-intensive institutions in the UK and is internationally recognized for excellent research and teaching across the arts, sciences, social sciences and management. It is set in a beautiful campus in a safe location with plenty to experience in the local area and easy access to vibrant and active central London. It was ranked 88% for overall student satisfaction, making Royal Holloway rank above the sector average (National Student Survey (NSS) 2019).\nPathway courses at OnCampus London lead to a degree program at Royal Holloway University.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n31/03/2026 10:15\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n31/03/2026 10:15\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £24,313.00\nMin: £16,794.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n20%\n2,100 of 10,500 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nStudy Group\nFounded Year\n1849\nCampus(es)\nEgham\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n01/04/2026\nContract End Date\n31/12/2026\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cFKC2QXN45w\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
